<title>INDIA: Indian Feb industrial output up 2.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Indian Feb industrial output up 2.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's index of industrial production increased by 2.4 percent in February 1997 over the same month in 1996, a government statement said on Friday.</p>
<p>    INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION     Feb 97    Jan 97    Feb 96</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	  +2.4	+1.1     +13.3</p>
<p>     -Mining			 -2.0	-1.3	+5.9</p>
<p>     -Manufacturing		+3.2	+0.9     +15.7</p>
<p>     -Electricity		  +1.4	+4.2	+6.2</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1980/81)  312.8     315.7    305.5</p>
<p>Note - Figures for February 1997 are preliminary. Figures for February 1996 have been revised.  </p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    CUMULATIVE			Apr96-Feb97    Apr95-Feb96</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change		+7.0	    +11.8</p>
<p>     -Mining			     +1.0	    +7.7</p>
<p>     -Manufacturing		    +8.6	   +13.0</p>
<p>     -Electricity			+3.6	    +8.3</p>
<p>     Index (base 100=1980/81)     298.1	   278.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures for February 1997 are preliminary.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
